		<h1>Made with care</h1>
		<p class="lede">Grand Daze is a growing family project. This first chapter is shaped by the people, places, and quiet details that make a retreat worth returning to.</p>
		<div class="credit-list">
			<div><span>Brand &amp; direction</span><strong>Grand Daze family</strong></div>
			<div>
				<span>Digital experience</span>
				<div class="credit-details">
					<a href="https://linkedin.com/in/raitch" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Taking shape thanks to Rob<span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
					<small>Original Projector Image by <a href="https://www.vectorportal.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Vectorportal.com</a>, <a href="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">CC BY</a><br>Animation added</small>
				</div>
			</div>
			<div><span>Property photography</span><a href="https://www.soleilmediabs.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Soleil Media<span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div>
			<div><span>Place</span><strong>Elbow Cay, Abacos, The Bahamas</strong></div>
		</div>
	</section>
</Layout>
